Meta Home Link
==============

Portions of this project are ports of the Muse Gadget SDK
(https://github.com/facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk), licensed
under the Apache License 2.0:

- proto.py, noise.py: Noise transport envelope and Noise_XX_25519_AESGCM_SHA256
  (SDK: linux/src/musegadget/noise/)
- pairing.py: BLE pairing protocol v5, community / confirm_app
  (SDK: linux/src/musegadget/{pairing,ble_setup,ble_framing}.py)
- muse_link.py: fetch_vms, token refresh, Noise session, link.register
  (SDK: Linux device client session layer)

This project is a community integration. It is not affiliated with
or endorsed by Meta. "Meta", "Muse" and "Home Link" are trademarks
of their respective owners; they are used here only to describe
interoperability.
